--- Quartus Flow ---
     'make <module_name>' to build module
     'make <module_name>_tb' to build module + testbench
     'make <module_name>.sim' to sim tb on cmd line
     'make <module_name>.wav' to sim tb with gui
     'make <module_name>.syn' to synthesize functional net list
     'make <module_name>.synt' to synthesize timing net list

